@startuml
title State Diagram - Payment Life Cycle (section 2.5)
hide empty description

[*] --> Initiated : payment created

Initiated --> FundsHeld : Checks pass AND\nwallet has enough funds
Initiated --> Rejected : Check fails OR\ninsufficient funds
FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : request sent to biller
SentToBiller --> Completed : biller confirms
SentToBiller --> Failed : biller refuses
SentToBiller --> Unknown : no answer within 10 s
Unknown --> Completed : biller later confirms\n(callback, re-query, settlement file)
Unknown --> Failed : biller later refuses OR\nreconciliation finds no payment
Failed --> Refunded : hold released to wallet

Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]


@enduml
